 $('overviewNote').textContent=`${valid.length} of ${all.length} filtered readings have calculable ${g.toUpperCase()} flux. Statistics give equal weight to each included reading; readings missing required inputs or usable data are excluded. Complete unreviewed readings are included provisionally. Orange = emission; teal = uptake. Mean and median describe the sampled readings, not an area-weighted site flux. Flux rates are not summed and this is not time-integrated cumulative emission. Timing warnings remain available in the measurement register.`;
